        "created_at": "2023-05-02T23:28:02.106Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nobody else wants to play this game, eh?  Well, this one’s only tangentially a podcast villain (he’s inspired by a rejected name for a Fashion villain) but I’ll link to his writeup on my blog anyway:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://villainyunpublished.blogspot.com/2023/05/sir-needler-septuagenarian-knight-of.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sir Needler, An Extremely Bitter Tailor</a></p>\n<p>You’d want to reskin his demonic patron into Gloomweaver for gaming in the actual Sentinel Comics setting, but that’s easy enough.</p>",
