        "raw": "Nobody else wants to play this game, eh?  Well, this one's only tangentially a podcast villain (he's inspired by a rejected name for a Fashion villain) but I'll link to his writeup on my blog anyway:\n\n[Sir Needler, An Extremely Bitter Tailor](https://villainyunpublished.blogspot.com/2023/05/sir-needler-septuagenarian-knight-of.html) \n\nYou'd want to reskin his demonic patron into Gloomweaver for gaming in the actual Sentinel Comics setting, but that's easy enough.",
